<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://use.fontawesome.com/releases/v5.5.0/css/all.css">
  <style class="text/css">
    .main {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
    .title {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .select_button {
      padding: 10px 35%;
    }
    .play_button {
      margin-top: 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: solid 5px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: inherit;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    .play_button:hover {
      color: #ff321e;
    }
    .vocabulary_button {
      margin-top: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: solid 5px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: inherit;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    .vocabulary_button:hover {
      color: #ff321e;
    }
    .article {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .bottom {
      min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);
    }
    .bottom_image {
      padding-left: 30px;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    .share_area {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-direction: row;
      background-color: gray;
      color: white;
    }
    .share_area,
    ul {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }
    .share_area,
    li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      margin-right: 20px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      list-style: none;
    }
  </style>
  <title>メニュー画面</title>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="main">
    <div class="title">
      <img src="../images/English_game_title_update.png" alt="ゲームタイトル" height="200px">
    </div>
    <div class="select_button">
      <a class="play_button" href="/start">ゲームを遊ぶ</a>
      <a class="vocabulary_button" href="/vocabulary" ><i class="fas fa-eye" style="font-size: 18px; padding-right: 10px;"></i>収録されている英単語を見る</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="article">
    <span>このゲームはN高等学校/静岡キャンパス/キャンパスフェスティバルにより作成されたものです</span>
  </div>
  <footer class="bottom">
    <section class="share_area">
      <img class="bottom_image" src="../images/N_school.png" alt="N高ロゴ" width="auto" height="60px">
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com" target="_blank">
            <img src="../images/Instagram.png" alt="インスタ" width="40px" height="40px">
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="http://x.com" target="_blank">
            <img src="../images/x.png" alt="ツイッター" width="40px" height="40px">
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>